{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"色同伦论"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"学科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"色同伦论"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>色同伦论 (chromatic homotopy theory) 可认为是对 "},{"Local":{"url":"Sp","text":"$\\mathsf{Sp}$"}},{"Plain":" 的"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定∞-范畴的素谱","text":"素谱"}},{"Plain":"的研究. 我们有\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Sp} \\approx \\mathsf{QCoh}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fg}},\\mathcal O^{\\mathrm{top}}),\r\n$$\n其中</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathsf{QCoh}(X,\\mathcal O)$ 表示环层 $\\mathcal O$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"拟凝聚层","text":"拟凝聚模"}},{"Plain":"范畴 $\\mathsf{QCoh}(X,\\mathcal O):= \\operatorname{lim}_{f\\colon \\operatorname{Spec}R\\to X}\\mathsf{Mod}(\\mathcal O(f))$,</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fg}}$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"形式群的模叠","text":"形式群的模叠"}},{"Plain":",</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal O^{\\mathrm{top}}$ 是环谱层\n$$\r\n\\mathcal O^{\\mathrm{top}}\r\n\\colon (f\\colon \\operatorname{Spec}R\\to\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fg}})\\mapsto \\Gamma_f,\r\n$$</li>\n<li>$\\Gamma_f$ 为形式群 $f$ 对应的"},{"Local":{"url":"复定向上同调理论","text":"复定向环谱"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"MoravaK-理论","text":"Morava K-理论"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}